# Strip notebook outputs on the way into the index. Outputs stay in your working
# copy; git just never sees them. `scripts/method_comparison/method_comparison.ipynb`
# had accumulated five committed output blobs of 1.5-6.2 MB before this existed.
#
# The filter is per-clone: after cloning, run
#     pip install nbstripout && nbstripout --install --attributes .gitattributes
# Without it git errors on checkout ("required filter nbstripout failed").
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout diff=ipynb
